#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fan Control KDE -- tray icon only. No windows, no dialogs.

The icon is painted every frame rather than loaded from a file, which is what
lets it spin at a rate taken from the measured RPM, cycle colour, and follow the
panel's own foreground in light and dark themes.

Speed is picked from a level list: a tray menu is exported over DBusMenu and
drawn by the panel, and that protocol carries only labels, checkmarks,
separators and submenus -- an embedded slider has no representation in it.
"""
